    "title": "Crawford Area Transportation Authority Unveils new Improvements for Public Transportation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stephanie Logue ,\n5 hours ago The Crawford Area Transportation Authority is marking a major milestone today with the official opening of its newly upgraded maintenance and operations facility. The authority serves both Crawford and Venango counties, providing fixed-route bus service as well as door-to-door shared ride transportation. For many older adults and riders with disabilities, these services remain the only affordable and reliable way to reach work, medical appointments, and other essential destinations. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
